{"suttaId":"tha-ap505","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[3036,3053],"vripara":"51"},"segments":{"tha-ap505:0.3":"Kāsumāraphaliyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap505:1.1":"“Kaṇikāraṃva jotantaṃ, nisinnaṃ pabbatantare;","tha-ap505:1.3":"Addasaṃ virajaṃ buddhaṃ, lokajeṭṭhaṃ narāsabhaṃ.","tha-ap505:2.1":"“Pasannacitto sumano, sire katvāna añjaliṃ;","tha-ap505:2.3":"Kāsumārikamādāya, buddhaseṭṭhassadāsahaṃ.","tha-ap505:3.1":"“Ekatiṃse ito kappe, yaṃ phalaṃ adadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap505:3.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, phaladānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap505:4.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap505:5.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap505:6.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap505:7.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā kāsumāraphaliyo thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap505:8.1":"Kāsumāraphaliyattherassāpadānaṃ tatiyaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
